text.en:
The Undersecretary of National Defense for Civilian Relations shall have the following
(a) Establish and maintain effective liaison between the Department of National Defense and the Department
of Local Government and Community Development and local governments, for the purpose of coordinating
local development efforts;
(b) Promote coordination and cooperation between units of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) and the
Integrated National Police (INP) in the field on one hand and local executives and authorities on the other;
(c) Develop programs and formulate policies and guidelines for the supervision and operation of the Office of
the Civil Relations (OCR).
(d) Formulate and oversee the implementation of troop information programs designed to instill in the soldier
the conviction and determination to uphold and advance the ideals of the New Society;
(e) Formulate and oversee the implementation of public information programs that will enhance the prestige
of the armed services and thereby inspire the confidence of the people in the organization;
(f) Monitor the activities of military units/personnel assigned to civilian agencies of the government;
(g) Oversee the activities of veterans organizations; and
(h) Such other functions as the Secretary of National Defense may assign to him from time to time.
